%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: ec4ba6a512adabf4b8a74985cb2f4d14, type: 3}
  m_Name: ButcherIntroDialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::ScriptedDialogue
  nodes:
  - type: 0
    npcLine: First shift at this post? I can always tell. You're deciding whether
      to say something about the face or pretend it's completely normal. You don't
      have to pick one.
    animationTrigger: TalkIdle
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleText: 0
    choices: []
  - type: 1
    npcLine: "Meat grinder. Three years back. If you're wondering how bad \u2014
      bad enough that the gauze is permanent. I tried going without it once. Cleared
      the whole market row in under a minute."
    animationTrigger: TalkCocky
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleText: 0
    choices:
    - playerChoiceText: Did it hurt?
      npcResponse: Not the way you'd expect. The machine's fast. You don't really
        feel it until an hour later, when the adrenaline drops and you look down
        at what you're holding.
      animationTrigger: TalkLookDown
    - playerChoiceText: You went back to work after that?
      npcResponse: "Next morning. My brother wanted me to take a week off. I told
        him the cows were already dead \u2014 they weren't getting any fresher."
      animationTrigger: TalkSmile
  - type: 0
    npcLine: "Pavle Asatiani. Everyone at the market calls me the Butcher, which
      \u2014 yes, that is literally my job. It was never a very creative nickname."
    animationTrigger: TalkIdle
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleText: 0
    choices: []
  - type: 0
    npcLine: I run the stall at the end of the market row. Beef, pork, whatever the
      distributors can still push through the gates. Business has picked up since
      the quarantine started. People eat when they're afraid. I've stopped being
      surprised by it.
    animationTrigger: TalkLookAway
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleText: 0
    choices: []
  - type: 1
    npcLine: "You'll be seeing me fairly often \u2014 late shifts, after close. You'll
      get used to the face. Everyone does, by the third or fourth time."
    animationTrigger: TalkIdle
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleText: 0
    choices:
    - playerChoiceText: I'm not bothered by it.
      npcResponse: Good. That saves us both some time.
      animationTrigger: TalkSmile
    - playerChoiceText: What does your brother think?
      npcResponse: "He cried for a week. Still tears up sometimes if the light catches
        it wrong. I keep telling him I'm fine \u2014 I'm the one wearing it."
      animationTrigger: TalkLookDown
  - type: 0
    npcLine: "Papers are right here. The red on the corner is from work. It's always
      from work. Everything's in order \u2014 I'm meticulous about paperwork. You'd
      be surprised what happens to a business when you're not."
    animationTrigger: TalkPoint
    cameraTrigger: 
    wobbleText: 0
    choices: []
